1
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:04,966
Everyone wants to get better at investing.

2
00:00:05,716 --> 00:00:10,959
When the market drops, we tell ourselves
we'll buy the dip. Just not yet.

3
00:00:11,359 --> 00:00:14,578
Then it drops further, and we start hesitating.

4
00:00:14,928 --> 00:00:19,384
By the time it bounces back,
we're watching the chart climb without us.

5
00:00:19,984 --> 00:00:23,370
When prices rise,
we're scared of buying too high.

6
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:26,854
When they fall, we wait
for an even better price.

7
00:00:27,904 --> 00:00:31,484
Traditional DCA solves half the problem.

8
00:00:31,934 --> 00:00:35,387
Invest on a schedule. A fixed amount.

9
00:00:35,397 --> 00:00:37,853
No matter how the market feels.

10
00:00:38,403 --> 00:00:43,371
But when it's time to actually place
the order, hesitation creeps back in.

11
00:00:43,721 --> 00:00:45,656
Maybe it's too expensive.

12
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:47,867
Maybe it's better to wait.

13
00:00:49,317 --> 00:00:51,257
This is DCA Score.

14
00:00:51,267 --> 00:00:53,779
One last look before you buy.

15
00:00:54,429 --> 00:01:00,471
It turns the real-time state of an asset
into a single score, from 0 to 100.

16
00:01:00,921 --> 00:01:04,058
And that score decides
how much goes in this time.

17
00:01:04,068 --> 00:01:07,807
The normal amount, or more. Never less.

18
00:01:08,357 --> 00:01:10,388
The schedule stays the same.

19
00:01:10,398 --> 00:01:13,008
The score just adjusts the size.

20
00:01:13,958 --> 00:01:17,728
Check any stock, ETF or crypto in seconds.

21
00:01:18,128 --> 00:01:20,909
Rank your watchlist by opportunity.

22
00:01:21,309 --> 00:01:25,211
Backtest the rules against years
of real market history.

23
00:01:25,611 --> 00:01:30,044
Get a portfolio checkup through
the eyes of Wall Street masters.

24
00:01:30,444 --> 00:01:33,754
And every week,
see where the strongest signals are.

25
00:01:34,804 --> 00:01:36,715
We don't tell you what to buy.

26
00:01:36,725 --> 00:01:38,585
We don't predict the market.

27
00:01:38,595 --> 00:01:40,895
And we don't promise returns.

28
00:01:41,545 --> 00:01:48,457
We believe in three things.
Discipline. Conviction. Action.

29
00:01:50,107 --> 00:01:52,816
You don't need to get every market move right.

30
00:01:52,826 --> 00:01:55,996
You need a method you can actually stick with.

31
00:01:56,746 --> 00:02:00,892
DCA Score. One last look before you buy.

